WEBVTT

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:17.740
I've been waiting for this.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:21.720
Today we settle our years-old score!

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:42.430
This is the end!

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:44.760
My ultimate technique:

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:49.320
World End Ultimatum Spreading 
Three-Bar Charge Attack!

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:55.850
W-Why you...

00:00:55.850 --> 00:00:59.580
You can't attack in the middle 
of my move, it's not fair!

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:08.240
Damn it!

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:10.700
That's why I hate Rucos!

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:13.020
They jump around 
and you can never tell

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:15.090
when to start charging your attack, 
and they've got scary faces!

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:17.730
How am I supposed to win?

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:19.350
Maybe I'll switch weapons.

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:20.210
Gunner, maybe?

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:21.810
But I suck at fighting with low HP.

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:28.060
Turn on your voice chat.

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:29.650
What's this?

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:30.560
Voice chat: ON

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:33.290
Hello there.

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:34.560
Um, uh...

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:37.450
Sorry to just talk to 
you out of nowhere.

00:01:37.870 --> 00:01:40.160
My name's Flora. Nice to meet you.

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.990
Um, h-hi...

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:45.620
You're so cute when you're embarrassed.

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:49.290
Hey, Kon-kun.

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:51.960
I know this is sudden, but...

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:56.510
Please, help me.

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:00.010
S-Seriously?

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:36.650
Yeah.

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.040
I may not look it,

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:40.450
but I've got a strong sense 
of responsibility. I mean,

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.180
when something needs done, I do it.

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.620
I think I'm the type who 
takes good care of things.

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:47.330
I thought so.

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.360
I'm the same way in the real world

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:50.120
in a lot of ways.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:51.350
Really?

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:52.620
Glad to hear it.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:54.920
Because I actually need your help

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.000
in the real world, not the game.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.260
<i>From her voice she's gotta be a girl.</i>

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:02.280
<i>And her voice is cute enough</i>

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:04.870
<i>that she could be a voice actress!</i>

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:08.980
<i>I'm sure if her voice is that cute, 
she's gotta be cute, too!</i>

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:12.890
<i>And if a girl like that 
is talking to me...</i>

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:16.270
I've looked for a long time

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:20.320
for somebody kind and strong like you.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:22.780
<i>She's definitely got the hots for me!</i>

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:27.460
I-I'm glad I met you, too.

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:29.410
I'm happy.

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:31.410
<i>At last, I've...</i>

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:36.040
Then will you do this for me?

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:37.670
<i>At last, I've...</i>

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:45.930
If you do, I'll give you something 
<i>very</i> important to me.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:48.760
<i>I've finally found love!</i>

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:53.230
<i>She's definitely hitting on me!</i>

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:55.060
<i>She's basically asking me out!</i>

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:59.440
<i>And if you ask me, I'd say 
she's basically proposing.</i>

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:01.980
<i>At times like this, 
a man should forge ahead!</i>

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:06.740
Kon-kun...

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:08.020
All right.

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:11.410
I'll do anything I can.

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:13.540
Thank you.

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.350
So why don't we meet?

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:17.390
Where are you?

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:18.780
I can go anywhere in Tokyo,

00:05:18.780 --> 00:05:20.520
or even out to Saitama any time.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:23.300
I could even get out to the
Kansai area with a day pass!

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:24.780
Don't worry.

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:27.970
I'll be seeing you very soon.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:45.940
Get into that forest!

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:46.450
Right!

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:22.020
Get them.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:33.900
Princess!

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.960
Looks like this is the end for you,

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.670
Steel Sainglain.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:52.030
If you know who I am,

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:55.350
then you must know who she is, too!

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:58.480
Enough talk.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.550
Hand over the princess,

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:03.230
and out of respect for
 your name, I won't kill you.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.170
Don't insult me.

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:07.600
I, Steel Sainglain,

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:10.070
will never forget my duty,

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:12.660
even if I am the last man standing!

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.820
I see.

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:19.910
Then I'll eliminate you, 
and fulfill my objective!

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:35.470
Ow...

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:39.000
Variation-sama!

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.700
Princess! Now!

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:47.610
Sainglain, take him too.

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:05.260
Th-That hurt.

00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:08.300
Variation-sama!

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:18.670
Um, well...

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:20.550
Who are you?

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:21.430
Where did you come from?

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:22.870
If you fell from the sky, does that mean

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:24.230
you came from Olvidia?

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:25.740
And why are you dressed like that?

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:27.610
And what was that light?

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:29.480
It looked like the Light of Alma.

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.660
Stop asking so many questions!

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:33.810
I'm the one who's got questions here.

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:35.160
And where are we?

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:37.570
The outskirts of St. Piria.

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:39.760
Thirty or so to the east.

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:42.620
I see. St. Piria.

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.060
Where the hell is St. Piria?

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:45.940
What kind of name is that?

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:47.800
It sounds like it's 
from a fantasy novel!

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:50.750
It's so generic, even an anime 
wouldn't use it these days!

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:52.690
I see.

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:54.260
I get it.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:58.130
If the CIA doesn't have 
me on candid camera,

00:08:58.130 --> 00:08:59.410
this is a dream.

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:02.270
That's right. Has to be a dream.

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:06.690
It's not a dream, moron!

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:09.650
That hurt.

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:11.530
What was that for, you stupid kid?

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:15.070
Who do you think this person is?

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:18.630
The 36th Princess of St. Piria,

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:22.950
Princess Ecarlate Juptris St. Piria!

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:25.100
A princess? Her?

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:27.050
Is there a problem?

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:28.800
The slightest rudeness towards her

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:30.380
and I kill you where you stand.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:31.520
Got it?

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:32.960
G-Got it!

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.620
Not that it matters, but this is weird.

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:39.720
Just in terms of settings.

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:41.790
What's weird?

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:45.160
Everybody knows a princess is a 
beautiful, slightly older woman.

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:47.760
Not a brat with a nasty tongue like her.

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:50.480
You know, like her!

00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:52.260
Oh my, you flatter me.

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:54.790
Sorry, I'm just the type 
who says what I think.

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:56.760
I'm Mariandel.

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:59.300
The princess's maid.

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:00.300
Nice to meet you.

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:01.340
Kon!

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:02.360
Hokaze Kon.

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:03.720
Nice to meet you!

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:05.060
I'd rather get to know

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:08.270
a pretty girl than a musclehead 
with a sword fetish

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:10.100
or a bratty little twerp.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:11.320
Hey,

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:13.250
that's a guy.

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:16.130
You can touch me if you want.

00:10:21.770 --> 00:10:23.640
Now the setting is even more messed up!

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:27.650
I was a fool to get my hopes up.

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:29.280
And I'm not even sure where to start

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:30.650
with everything that's wrong with this!

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:33.940
That's what you get for drooling.

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.820
You got a problem with 
me being a guy, huh?

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:38.450
Calm down, everyone.

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:40.450
Jeez.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:42.630
This whole situation is messed up, 
and to make matters worse,

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:46.180
the people I need to get info 
from are even more messed up.

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:48.460
Calm down, Kon.

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:51.280
The next thing you do at 
a time like this is...

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.530
Um, ever heard of Shimorenjaku?

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:55.710
That's where I'm from.

00:10:57.440 --> 00:10:59.190
I'm so stupid!

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:00.710
Why am I asking a question when it'd

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:02.140
be shocking if they knew the answer!

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:04.520
But aren't I a little silly for thinking

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:10.340
"Oh, maybe St. Whatsits and 
Mitaka are sister cities!"

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:12.150
Hey, Kon.

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:14.420
Why don't you answer our questions?

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:15.820
Not happening!

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:17.780
I don't know a damn thing.

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:21.280
I didn't expect you to fail.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:24.530
I'm terribly sorry, Erec-sama.

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:26.190
What happened?

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:28.140
Well...

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:32.240
A strangely dressed man 
fell from the sky.

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:33.170
What?

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:37.670
Uh, his attack caught me off guard.

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:45.510
So he must be a man capable of 
catching Variation off guard.

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:50.020
It's been a while since 
I've had a tough fight.

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.980
Hey, Leon, KT.

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:55.770
You guys really think beating 
Variation makes him tough?

00:11:57.430 --> 00:11:59.030
Interesting.

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:06.140
It looks like I'll have to 
see this man for myself.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:13.550
So basically you were surrounded

00:12:13.550 --> 00:12:15.680
and I fell from the sky and saved your butt.

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:20.600
Even if you hadn't, 
I would've been all right.

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:24.690
Oh, but that doesn't change 
the fact that he saved us.

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.300
We have to thank him somehow.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:30.070
Why were they attacking you anyway?

00:12:30.070 --> 00:12:32.230
Did you do something wrong?

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:34.570
Don't be stupid.

00:12:34.570 --> 00:12:38.320
The princess is heading 
towards the capital

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:39.760
to marry Lord Jugglaburk.

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:45.630
It must've been the militarist 
faction that attacked us.

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:49.120
They don't want a union 
between St. Piria and Jugglaburk.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:52.750
Does that mean you're older than me?

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.440
You look really young.

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:56.130
Like about ten.

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:57.500
I'm eight.

00:12:58.110 --> 00:12:59.560
That's a crime!

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:01.880
There's a crime underway, right here!

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:06.450
Do you even know what 
marriage means anyway?

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:07.580
What does it mean?

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:13.270
Marriage means you have to 
do this, that, and even that!

00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:15.350
Oh, that.

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:17.310
What do you mean, that?

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:18.880
You're way too young.

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:20.340
Even I'm still a virg—

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:23.440
Wait, I'm not the one 
we're talking about here!

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:24.640
Are you sure about this?

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:26.590
Her getting married even 
though she's a kid?

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:29.220
Don't ask me about marriage.

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:31.120
It makes things difficult.

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:33.120
Am I the bride or the groom?

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:36.490
That's true, but, marriage...

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:37.230
It's fine.

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:42.000
I said it's fine, so it's fine.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.130
So leave me alone.

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:48.010
So what are you going to do now?

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:49.770
What?

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:51.700
I don't know the first 
thing about this place.

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:53.800
I can't answer that.

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:55.690
Our first priority is to shake off

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:57.310
our pursuers and get to safety.

00:13:57.840 --> 00:14:02.110
I guess I have to find 
a way back to my world.

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:03.640
Ow!

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:08.910
Ow, I stepped on a rock.

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:14.080
Listen. I've got a request.

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:18.790
I can't believe you want shoes 
as thanks for saving us.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.710
There's nothing wrong with it.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:24.050
It's true that there's other 
things we need to buy.

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:27.930
But I would imagine they're 
watching for us here.

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:29.800
Keep an eye out.

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:31.990
Want one?

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:33.340
We're all right.

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:35.110
Thanks!

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:39.060
Those are the Maidds, 
they're master merchants.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:44.780
Which should I get?

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.800
How about this one?

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:48.000
It looks tough.

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:49.870
It looks like something 
an old man would wear.

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:50.530
Old man...

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.610
I think I'd buy this one.

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:54.410
I'm a guy!

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:56.540
This is good enough for you.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.790
Wear it. If you can!

00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:02.490
No sense in obsessing over it, really.

00:15:02.490 --> 00:15:05.590
What's the thing to do when 
someone else is paying...

00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:09.990
Hey mister, give me the most 
expensive shoes in the store.

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:11.430
You got it!

00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:14.950
Lame.

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:16.840
What's important with shoes 
isn't what they look like.

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:19.620
What's important is how 
they feel on your feet.

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:21.940
They don't look very comfortable.

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:27.850
Well, we've finished our shopping.

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:30.000
Sainglain, where to...

00:15:30.890 --> 00:15:32.610
Two of them behind us.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:34.180
They're probably going to wait

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:35.740
for reinforcements and surround us.

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:37.380
What do we do?

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:38.780
Run, of course.

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:41.240
But we're going to make a 
lot of noise when we do it.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:43.740
Kon, I'll count from three.

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:46.070
When I'm done, run into that alley.

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:46.860
Got it?

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:48.550
Oh, sure.

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:50.030
Get ready, too, princess.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:53.800
Three, two, one, run!

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:07.330
Take it.

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:09.900
You can't fight them unarmed.

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:12.150
No, but I...

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:15.490
Now, let's get started.

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:20.050
Looks like it's begun.

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:22.900
So that's it.

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:25.550
You stay here.

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:25.970
Yes, sir!

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:27.800
Wait for my return.

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:28.490
Yes, sir!

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:39.770
Sainglain, you owe me dinner!

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:44.590
Seriously?

00:16:44.590 --> 00:16:47.380
How'd I get caught up in all this?

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:51.880
Hey, aren't you scared?

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:52.810
Why?

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:54.330
Why?

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:59.500
Sainglain and Marian swore 
to always protect me.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.190
So you believe in them?

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:05.510
Kon! Princess!

00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:07.870
This way!

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:09.150
Y-Yeah.

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:12.030
Wait up!

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:24.100
Okay, now we head straight east.

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:31.550
What are you doing?

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:32.950
Let's get going.

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:35.320
Don't you think it's weird?

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:38.260
There's not a single enemy 
guard at the city gates.

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:40.650
Worrying about it won't help.

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:42.840
Or do we go back to the middle of town

00:17:42.840 --> 00:17:44.450
where it's crawling with them?

00:17:45.030 --> 00:17:46.440
But still...

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:49.810
Fine, I'll go look then.

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:50.750
Wait!

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:56.380
Looks like it's okay!

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:58.180
That idiot.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:00.160
But he's right.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:02.620
We can't keep hiding in here forever.

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:04.510
Fine.

00:18:07.590 --> 00:18:10.400
Sorry. That was a lie.

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:15.400
Maybe it's not so okay.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.530
I've been waiting.

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:24.420
That's...

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:26.510
You know him?

00:18:26.510 --> 00:18:27.700
He's so hot!

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:29.120
I think he's my type!

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:30.380
Seriously?

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:33.450
My name is Erec.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:36.380
Erecpyle Dukakis.

00:18:36.860 --> 00:18:38.720
ED for short?

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:42.010
A splendid escape.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.090
But you couldn't quite pull it off.

00:18:44.610 --> 00:18:47.560
You couldn't fool me.

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:49.480
Who can't pull it off?!

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:51.470
What are you gonna do all by yourself?

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:53.610
We've got two people here!

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:55.480
Not three?

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:58.400
Wait, are you really strong, too?

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:04.260
The age when numbers decide the 
outcome of a battle is over.

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:07.750
From now on, it's time for a new era.

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:10.130
At the hands of this Alma Gear,

00:19:10.130 --> 00:19:12.670
and the Hyperion who controls it!

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:14.180
What is he talking about?

00:19:14.180 --> 00:19:15.570
Is this FF?

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:17.550
Stop trying to show off, 
it's not working.

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:20.200
Kon.

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:23.460
If something happens to us, 
take care of the princess.

00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:28.480
He's just that strong.

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:31.230
Wait a second, I can't...

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:34.110
He's clearly a difficult opponent.

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:35.210
Impossible!

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:38.050
I've never used one of these, 
and I don't want to get killed!

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:39.860
And I'd be even more upset 
if I had to kill somebody!

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:43.570
Then pray you don't have to.

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:46.700
Seriously?

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:49.080
Are you ready?

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:51.400
Then...

00:19:52.140 --> 00:19:53.420
Here I go!

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:56.250
Marian, don't let him 
get near the princess!

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:57.260
Roger!

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:01.630
No you don't!

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:07.240
A splendid attack.

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:09.270
You must be a talented swordsman.

00:20:11.190 --> 00:20:15.020
But against this sword, 
that means nothing!

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:22.700
Sainglain!

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:34.540
You're joking.

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:36.250
He took them both out in one strike?

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:49.890
Are you the boy who 
defeated Variation?

00:20:52.320 --> 00:20:54.980
It looks like you're 
not what I expected.

00:21:04.980 --> 00:21:08.360
I'd hoped you'd entertain 
me at least a little.

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:10.130
Now then.

00:21:14.650 --> 00:21:18.090
Stay away from me, insolent man.

00:21:20.560 --> 00:21:21.590
Princess...

00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:24.220
I apologize for my insolence.

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:27.170
But this is all for the greater good.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:29.210
I'm not down yet!

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:31.220
Kon!

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:37.860
You're still standing?

00:21:38.210 --> 00:21:40.570
I'm the type who can 
never forgive a man

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:42.360
who makes a woman cry.

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:45.850
Sorry. That was a lie.

00:21:46.390 --> 00:21:49.050
No, more importantly than that, 
more than anything...

00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:52.950
I have something I can 
never give up on.

00:21:53.310 --> 00:21:54.280
I...

00:21:54.690 --> 00:21:57.300
I'm not dying while I'm still a vir—

00:21:58.650 --> 00:22:02.590
Before I get rid of my DT, damn it!

00:22:03.440 --> 00:22:04.840
DT?

00:22:05.900 --> 00:22:07.630
I have no idea what 
you're talking about,

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:10.760
but your strong will impresses me!

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:13.430
As a sign of my respect,

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:16.520
I will finish you with 
my ultimate attack.

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:19.150
Ultimate attack?

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:21.650
Let my Alma burst forth!

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:26.240
What's this?

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:29.330
I'll put everything I have into this!

00:22:29.330 --> 00:22:33.120
Take this, my ultimate 
technique: Golden...

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:45.170
You're wide open, moron.

00:22:52.460 --> 00:22:55.720
I can't believe he defeated 
such a terrible opponent.

00:22:55.720 --> 00:22:57.340
Oh, stop it.

00:22:57.340 --> 00:23:01.400
Anyway, you took his sword.

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:03.610
Spoils of war, I guess.

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:06.500
Looks like we lost our pursuers.

00:23:07.250 --> 00:23:09.530
What will you do now, Kon?

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:13.990
Hm... For now I'll...

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:15.120
I've decided.

00:23:16.440 --> 00:23:19.750
Kon, I am appointing you my knight.

00:23:22.010 --> 00:23:25.300
This is an official order 
of the 36th Princess

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:28.780
of St. Piria, Ecarlate Juptris St. Piria.

00:23:29.350 --> 00:23:30.880
You should be grateful.

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:32.420
You're kidding me.

00:23:32.420 --> 00:23:34.510
Why do I have to be your servant?

00:23:35.330 --> 00:23:37.980
It's an official order 
from the princess.

00:23:38.740 --> 00:23:41.950
You know what happens if you 
disobey her orders, right?

00:23:43.770 --> 00:23:45.680
Welcome to the party, Kon.

00:23:46.870 --> 00:23:49.590
Okay, here's your first order, servant.

00:23:50.050 --> 00:23:50.910
I want you to...

00:23:50.910 --> 00:23:51.910
I refuse!

00:23:51.910 --> 00:23:53.330
If you refuse, I'll kill you!

00:23:53.340 --> 00:23:54.300
I refuse that, too!

00:23:54.300 --> 00:23:55.420
Then will you do it for me?

00:23:55.420 --> 00:23:55.910
I refuse!

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:56.980
What do you mean you refuse?

00:23:56.980 --> 00:23:57.750
You're going to!

00:23:57.750 --> 00:23:58.960
I said no!

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:24.850
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:13.910
I became her servant without really 
knowing what was going on.

00:24:13.910 --> 00:24:16.400
And now I have to take an 
8-year-old girl to the capital

00:24:16.400 --> 00:24:18.390
so she can get married.

00:24:18.390 --> 00:24:21.600
But that ED guy attacks us again!

00:24:21.600 --> 00:24:23.300
I can't deal with this!

00:24:23.300 --> 00:24:24.850
Absolutely not!

00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:29.860
After losing the battle against Kon,

00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:29.860
Erec has lost half of something important.

00:24:29.860 --> 00:25:00.000
Hungering for revenge,

00:24:29.860 --> 00:25:00.000
Erec brings out the secret weapon Chariot.
